Date: Wed, 1 Apr 2026 18:16:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] add support for openRuyi

Add openRuyi Product to provide security configuration baseline scanning capability for openRuyi.
1. Build the openRuyi-related support framework
2. Add common openRuyi check items
